This is a half working _non released_ Message Section Mover, USE WITH EXTREME
CAUTION!

It has hard coded numbers in it, thus you should not run it unless you have
modified it to suit your particular scenario.

* NOTE * If you run this on your message base, without COMPLETELY knowing what
you're doing, then it is GUARANTEED to DESTROY it.

Could be made generic very quickly and thus become a useful tool.  I only
ever needed to use it once, that's why it's in such a hacked state!


To compile the source, you'll need SAS C 6.X.


